Changelog: 12-11-2026 13:24:26

Added. The BC250 Bazzite Suite (owner, 12-11-2026). Its portal: Files before Steam, two more shortcuts (Volume and
Screen), the status in three lines (the loads, the date and time, the weather) and a line at the bottom without "X /
Menu key". Its apps: Escape and a controller's B close the window in all 30 (core's new exit_keys; not B in the two
Remote Play apps, USB HD Control and System Overlay), and the six emulator managers have a tab Start game, which
starts the chosen game through Steam (core's new action_tab and steam.shortcut_number).
tools/tests/test_instance_copies.py also keeps the copies of exit_keys.py in the apps that are not on core equal to
core's. The Nexus page's Development chapter lists the two new core modules; the suite's wiki has the rest (the
portal, The apps, the six managers, Architecture and consistency). The other suites did not change.

