Changelog: 12-11-2026 11:02:25

Fixed. The BC250 Bazzite Suite has the owner's new icons (12-11-2026): the suite's own (the portal's and the wiki's,
the purple circuit board redrawn) and those of the Gaming (a gray metal controller instead of the red one),
Sustainable and Utilities categories (their circuit boards redrawn), from the owner's PNGs at 1024, 512, 256 and
128 px. tools/sync_icons.py converted the category icons (WebP, the 128 px one PNG) and wrote the copies of the 27
apps of those categories, their portal tiles and the three category tiles. The Gaming pictures are wider than high
(1024 x 842 at the largest): each is centered on a transparent square of its width first, as the suite's icons must
be square. The Graphics pictures the owner sent are the icon the suite already has, so it did not change. The other
suites' icons are their own and did not change.

